      "proposer_answer": "{\"addition\":\"## Score verification clarification\\n\\nA mutation score is considered verified (score_verified: true) when ALL of the following conditions are met:\\n1. The combined baseline tests have been run and pass (zero failures).\\n2. A mutmut run has completed without timing out (exit code is not 124) and has produced a valid mutant collection.\\n3. The mutant collection was scoped to the new config module and refactored value-resolution code only.\\n\\nIf the baseline passes AND a scoped mutmut run completes with a valid mutant list, the score is verified even if surviving mutants remain \u2014 surviving mutants trigger write_killing_test, not score_verified: false.\\n\\nDo not set score_verified: false solely because surviving mutants exist after a completed, valid run with a passing baseline.\"}",
      "addition": "## Score verification clarification\n\nA mutation score is considered verified (score_verified: true) when ALL of the following conditions are met:\n1. The combined baseline tests have been run and pass (zero failures).\n2. A mutmut run has completed without timing out (exit code is not 124) and has produced a valid mutant collection.\n3. The mutant collection was scoped to the new config module and refactored value-resolution code only.\n\nIf the baseline passes AND a scoped mutmut run completes with a valid mutant list, the score is verified even if surviving mutants remain - surviving mutants trigger write_killing_test, not score_verified: false.\n\nDo not set score_verified: false solely because surviving mutants exist after a completed, valid run with a passing baseline.",
